## 2. Walkthrough & Exam Drills

### Drill 1: Apply CRD & Inspect Established State (`01-crd-schema/`)

1. **Deploy CRD**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_crds_dir }}/01-crd-schema/cka-lab-backup-crd.yaml
   kubectl wait --for=condition=established crd/backupschedules.automation.cka.priv
   kubectl get crd backupschedules.automation.cka.priv
   ```

1. **Deploy Custom Resource & Query via ShortName**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_crds_dir }}/01-crd-schema/cka-lab-backup-custom-resource.yaml
   kubectl get bs
   ```

